      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "차게 식는 답변이네요...\n이대로라면 손님들도 실망할 텐데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC28AC8C0020C2DDB2940020B2F5BCC0C774B124C694002E002E002E000AC774B300B85CB77CBA740020C190B2D8B4E4B3C40020C2E4B9DDD5600020D150B370002E002E002E001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불꽃타입 기술에 화상을 입을 것 같은\n뜨거운 승부를 부탁드립니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88AF43D0C0C7850020AE30C220C5D00020D654C0C1C7440020C785C7440020AC830020AC19C740000AB728AC70C6B40020C2B9BD80B97C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9BDB2C8B2E40021001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
