      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너인 저까지\n타오를 것 같은 승부였어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108C7780020C800AE4CC9C0000AD0C0C624B97C0020AC830020AC19C7400020C2B9BD80C600C5B4C694002E001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어때, 레오꼬?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이 정도 승부라면\n너도 진심을 다한 불꽃을 뿜어낼 수 있겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B54C002C0020B808C624AF2C003F00100001BE01000AC7740020C815B3C40020C2B9BD80B77CBA74000AB108B3C40020C9C4C2ECC7440020B2E4D55C0020BD88AF43C7440020BFDCC5B4B0BC0020C2180020C788ACA0C9C0003F001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크아앙!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CC544C55900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래, 레오꼬!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n진심이 담긴 스테이크를 굽기 위해선\n진심을 다해야 하는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798002C0020B808C624AF2C002100100001BE01000AC9C4C2ECC7740020B2F4AE340020C2A4D14CC774D06CB97C0020AD7DAE300020C704D574C120000AC9C4C2ECC7440020B2E4D574C57C0020D558B2940020AC70C57C0021001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감사합니다! 이건 답례예요.\n화상을 입은 포켓몬에게 사용해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
